@startuml j7-import-export
title J7 Load a shop file; export CSV
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
skinparam titleFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontColor #0E5C45
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #0E5C45
  LifeLineBorderColor #7FA89A
  ParticipantBorderColor #0E5C45
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ActorBorderColor #0E5C45
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  GroupBorderColor #0E5C45
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3F8F6
  DividerBorderColor #0E5C45
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #0E5C45
  BackgroundColor #E8F2EE
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #B08A2E
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  FontSize 12
}
actor "Shop owner\nor a tester" as Owner
participant "ImportBox, App.tsx" as UI
participant "Shop store\n(useShopStore)" as Store
participant "lib/validate" as Val
participant "lib/csv" as Csv
database "localStorage" as LS

== Load a shop file ==
Owner -> UI : pastes JSON into #import-box, presses #import-go
UI -> Store : importJson(text)
Store -> Store : JSON.parse
alt not JSON
  Store --> UI : importError "That is not valid JSON. Nothing was changed."
else parsed
  Store -> Val : validateImport(object)
  Val -> Val : customers: name, 10-digit phone (a number is accepted), no duplicate\nentries (may be absent): known phone, credit or payment,\nwhole amount above 0 ("500" is read as 500), date YYYY-MM-DD\nids from importIds() keep the order of the file
  alt a row fails
    Val --> Store : the first error, naming the row
    Store --> UI : importError "... Nothing was changed."
    UI --> Owner : the error under the box; the ledger is as it was
  else all rows pass
    Val --> Store : shop (or "Shop"), customers, entries
    Store -> LS : commit(): the whole ledger replaced; shop UPI id kept; Undo memory cleared
    alt the browser's store is full
      Store --> UI : importError "Storage is full. Nothing was changed."
    else written
      UI --> Owner : box emptied; status "Imported N customers."; new balances and total
    end
  end
end

== Export ==
Owner -> UI : presses Export balances or Export entries (home or Settings)
UI -> Csv : balancesCsv(customers, entries) or entriesCsv(customers, entries)
Csv --> UI : CSV text; the entries file has a running balance per customer
UI --> Owner : hisaab-balances.csv or hisaab-entries.csv downloaded through a temporary Blob link
note over UI, Csv : Built in the browser. Nothing is sent anywhere.
@enduml
